msgctxt "516"
msgid "Unconcerned Punk"
msgstr "Matón Despreocupado"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "84_Unconcerned Punk"
msgid "Wait, was that Majima-san? You hear his name all over town,\\r\nbut I've never actually seen the guy before."
msgstr "Espera, ¿era ese Majima-san? Escuchas su nombre por toda la ciudad,\\r\npero nunca he visto al tipo antes."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:translated_by=MasterCry
msgctxt "96_Unconcerned Punk"
msgid "Looks like a real piece of work. Little shitboy like me'll never compare to a top dog like that."
msgstr "Parece un verdadero fenómeno. Un mocoso como yo jamás se comparará con un crack como el."
